; =============================================================================
; rg_vm_only — the runtime half on its own
; =============================================================================
; Imports the VM and the JIT tier and nothing else: no frontend, no lowering
; pass, no compiler. Building this is how the engine measures the size of what
; a program would actually have to ship if its bytecode were produced ahead of
; time.

Import "../src/RgVM.rgr"
Import "../src/RgJsJit.rgr"
